  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Not all bones work with the auto-replacement.  The inertia seems to be missing?  Would need more testing...\nThe physbone appears to be moving, but it's not actually attached to the proper bones of the avatar, so it doesn't move.\nFor additional detail, is it still responds to collision, this apparent lack of weighting to the bones is only when the avatar moves.\n\nIf automatic conversion is to be automatically enabled for everyone, it NEEDS to be close and not broken.  In this state it ruins so many non-updated avatars.",
